      "title": "/devils-advocate-watcher",
      "description": "Logical devil's-advocate integration watcher — for every content block (.ts/.md) and Lean sibling (.lean), constructs the strongest adversarial case that it is WRONG: the objection a hostile-but- competent referee would raise (false claim, vacuity, circularity, overclaim, hidden DOF / numerology, logical non-sequitur, Lean↔narrative divergence, citation misuse, definitional ambiguity, empirical fragility, physical implausibility, irreproducible compute). Fans out multiple adversarial-lens agents per block, then an adjudicator scores whether each objection survives rebuttal. Persists per-block <block>.qa.json entries under the `da-*` criteria family (reviewer.kind = \"agent\"). Operationalizes the standing Critical-distance red-team license (AGENTS.md). Inherits all shared mechanics (Monitor, subscriptions, queue, ledger, idle sweep, author-ask, watch-prepared-PRs, witness-drift recovery, billing-quick-fail flake) from `local/integration-watcher`.",
